# The archive is byte-anchored: the genesis event and every checkpoint
# hash exact file bytes. Git must therefore NEVER translate line
# endings - not on checkout, not on commit, not on any machine, in any
# decade. Without this, a clone on a Windows machine (autocrlf=true is
# the installer default) checks out CRLF bytes and verify.py correctly
# reports every anchored founding document as altered. Discovered by
# the first drill clone, 2026-07-13.
* -text
